sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(Dashboard/SDK/CLI)
    participant RBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant API as eval-hub API<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP SQL
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Init as eval-runtime-init<br/>(init container)
    participant S3 as AWS S3<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Adapter as Eval Adapter<br/>(Python SDK)
    participant Sidecar as eval-runtime-sidecar<br/>8080/TCP HTTP (pod-local)
    participant Model as Model Endpoint<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow Tracking<br/>5000/TCP
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,OCI: Flow 1: Evaluation Job Submission (Cluster Mode)

    Client->>RBAC: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs<br/>HTTPS :8443, Bearer token
    RBAC->>API: Forward with X-Tenant, X-User headers<br/>HTTP :8080 (pod-local)
    API->>DB: INSERT evaluation job record<br/>SQL (pgx), TLS
    DB-->>API: Job ID
    API->>K8s: Create Job (3 containers)<br/>HTTPS :443, SA token
    K8s-->>API: Job created
    API-->>RBAC: 202 Accepted (job_id)
    RBAC-->>Client: 202 Accepted

    Note over Init,S3: Init Container Phase

    K8s->>Init: Schedule init container
    Init->>S3: Download test data<br/>HTTPS :443, AWS IAM credentials
    S3-->>Init: Test data files → /test_data/
    Init-->>K8s: Init complete

    Note over Adapter,OCI: Evaluation Execution Phase

    K8s->>Adapter: Start evaluation adapter
    K8s->>Sidecar: Start sidecar proxy

    Adapter->>Sidecar: Inference request<br/>HTTP :8080 (localhost)
    Sidecar->>Model: Forward with credential injection<br/>HTTPS, Bearer/ref-token/SA token
    Model-->>Sidecar: Inference response
    Sidecar-->>Adapter: Response

    Adapter->>Sidecar: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs/{id}/events<br/>HTTP :8080 (localhost)
    Sidecar->>API: Forward with SA token injection<br/>HTTP/HTTPS :8080, SA token
    API->>DB: UPDATE job status/results
    API->>MLflow: Create experiment, log run<br/>HTTP/HTTPS :5000, Bearer token
    MLflow-->>API: Run ID
    API->>OCI: Push evaluation card<br/>HTTPS :443, Docker config auth
    OCI-->>API: Manifest digest

    Note over Client,OCI: Flow 2: MCP Agent Interaction

    participant Agent as AI Agent / LLM
    participant MCP as evalhub-mcp<br/>3001/TCP

    Agent->>MCP: MCP Tool: submit_evaluation<br/>HTTP/HTTPS :3001 or stdio
    MCP->>API: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs<br/>HTTP :8080, Bearer token
    API->>DB: INSERT job
    API->>K8s: Create Job
    API-->>MCP: Job ID
    MCP-->>Agent: Tool result (job submitted)

    Agent->>MCP: MCP Tool: get_job_status<br/>HTTP/HTTPS :3001
    MCP->>API: GET /api/v1/evaluations/jobs/{id}<br/>HTTP :8080, Bearer token
    API->>DB: SELECT job status
    DB-->>API: Job record
    API-->>MCP: Job status + results
    MCP-->>Agent: Tool result (status/benchmarks)
